            {
              "_key": "c6l3-030",
              "_type": "keyTakeaways",
              "points": [
                "A single salaried taxpayer can touch six TDS provisions in one year, as a deductee on salary, interest and dividends and as a deductor on rent and property",
                "TDS deducted by you on rent or a property purchase is never your credit. It belongs to the landlord or seller",
